application   choupoSemiContinuous;
description   "Water tank drained through a valve, no controller: after a 50 % step in the inflow the level SELF-REGULATES to the closed-form h* = (Q/(Cv x))^2/g (0.998 m -> 2.245 m)";

verbosity     3;

startTime       0;        // s
endTime         24000;    // s  (~9 time constants of the new level)
deltaT          10.0;     // s
writeInterval   1200;     // s
